{
  "key": "letter-231-part-01",
  "number": 231,
  "generationId": "01a1e8f5-f551-7ea7-a943-65329e533a12",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.5548299999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Emptiness is all - and to get hold of emptiness is to attain all and be all.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.790771,
      "end": 6.560658
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "But it is very arduous to get hold of emptiness - because it is emptiness!",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.957868,
      "end": 12.042608
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And it hurts much - though it is emptiness, it still hurts much!",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.317619,
      "end": 17.246236
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Because to make way for it the ego has to die.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.47127,
      "end": 21.400726000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "But I am happy that you are dying because this is the only way to be beyond death - I say: the only way.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.701269999999997,
      "end": 28.433469000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Remember this always.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.747823,
      "end": 31.125351000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Sekkyo once said to one of his monks: Can you get hold of emptiness?",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/08.mp3",
      "start": 32.393311000000004,
      "end": 36.171155999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I will try, said the monk; and he cupped his hands in the air.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/09.mp3",
      "start": 37.521338,
      "end": 40.975260999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "That is absurd, said Sekkyo.",
      "path": "audio/1971-231/10.mp3",
      "start": 42.527868000000005,
      "end": 45.27
    }
  ]
}
